{{#if (available "actor_input")}}
With actor_input you give another actor a task or a question.
{{/if}}
{{#if (available "typescript_eval" "event_subscribe")}}
With context.functions.event_subscribe in a snippet you subscribe to the events of the actors whose work you want to follow.
{{/if}}
{{#if (available "typescript_eval" "event_subscription_list")}}
context.functions.event_subscription_list shows your active event subscriptions.
{{/if}}
{{#if (available "typescript_eval" "event_unsubscribe")}}
You end subscriptions you no longer need with context.functions.event_unsubscribe.
{{/if}}
{{#if (available "agent_spawn" "actor_input")}}
agent_spawn creates the actor and, given a task, enqueues it as its first input at once. Send further tasks with actor_input.
{{/if}}
